{"version":1,"content":"<p>魏浚笙（Jeffrey）和潘燦良在前晚（15日）一集的《地獄大狀》掀熱話，2人上演男男車廂激吻戲碼，咀得十分投入及肉緊，Jeffrey更表示是他從影以來最突破的一場戲，潘燦良昨天在社交平台分享劇照，並寫道：「喂⋯⋯吓⋯⋯俾人偷拍⋯⋯我哋」。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T14:59:12.506965+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T14:43:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T06:57:32.781629+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T14:57:36.372752+00:00","content_hash":"6e1be1df4ce17d7f5d302bd069135339734dff66e2f8e12f8175958fb3e44251","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}